 "lead": "A <span data-concept=\"first-order-linear-pde\">first-order linear PDE</span> for a function of position $x$ and time $t$, whose <span data-concept=\"pde-initial-condition\">initial condition</span> is a whole function of $x$, is solved by the <span data-concept=\"method-of-characteristics\">method of characteristics</span>: finding the curves in the $(x, t)$ plane along which the equation becomes an ODE. The <span data-concept=\"transport-equation\">transport equation</span> is the first case, and two worked examples carry the method to an equation with a source term and to one with variable coefficients.",
