   "prompt": "<ol type=\\\"a\\\"><li>Find the characteristic coordinates for the following equations:<ol><li>$\\kux+\\kut + \\ku = 1$, $\\ku(x,0) = \\cos(x)$,</li><li>$2\\kux+2\\kut +2\\ku = 2$, $\\ku(x,0) = \\cos(x)$.</li></ol></li><li>Solve the two equations using the coordinates.</li><li>Explain why you got the same solution, although the characteristic coordinates you found were different.</li></ol>",
